text = "[b][font_size= 32]Ruins of The Depths[/font_size][/b]
Unlocked at 0m

[i]\"They left us with this\"[i]

Even they were impressed, how mortals could build creations so far more grand than their own. Those towers breached even the Skylimit. However, when mortal soul gazed upon the golden clouds, they couldnt help but long for the apple the serpent offered."
