text = "[b][font_size= 32]The Stormzone[/font_size][/b]
Unlocked At 1000m
Info Unlocked At 1500m

[i]\"We cannot understand them, nor will they understand us.\"[/i]

\"Why can't we bear the same wealth, power, and prosperity as you? Why must we suffer while you live without pain, without sorrow, Without agony?\" We begged for an answer, and they returned with silence. Quiet, Quiet silence.

[font_size= 9] Yes, This areference.
I'm stuck on Hokma."
